  <name>Simon-Note</name>
  <summary>Fast, minimal note-taking app for GNOME</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Simon-Note is a minimal and fast note-taking application written in Rust using GTK4 and LibAdwaita.</p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>GNOME-style interface with header bar and dark/light theme support</li>
      <li>UTF-8 text file editing</li>
      <li>Efficient handling of large files (20-50 MB) with smooth scrolling</li>
      <li>Keyboard shortcuts for common operations</li>
      <li>Native GNOME integration with LibAdwaita</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">com.simonecompany.simonnote.desktop</launchable>
